      "record": {
        "knowledge_point": {
          "db_id": 17592186179719,
          "id": "7a43f82e-6682-56af-994a-b0bdf12b4095",
          "title": "Sketching the Gradient Vector Field of a Function"
        },
        "question": {
          ":question/id": "2b911584-5ab8-5740-8efb-3dad1c387421",
          ":question/problem": "Which of the following diagrams represents the gradient vector field of $f(x,y)=-\\left(\\frac{\\left(- x + y\\right)^2}{2}\\right)$ at the points $(2,-1)$, $(-2,-1)$, $(1,2)$?\n\nEach orange dot marks the tail of an arrow. All diagrams use the same scale, with one grid square representing one unit in each direction. A blue ring around a dot denotes a zero vector.",
          ":question/worked-solution": "The gradient is $\\nabla f=f_x\\mathbf{i}+f_y\\mathbf{j}$. Take the partial derivatives:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nf_x(x,y)&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial x}\\left(-\\left(\\frac{\\left(- x + y\\right)^2}{2}\\right)\\right) \\\\ &=-1\\cdot\\left(- x + y\\right)\\cdot(-1)=\\left(- x + y\\right) \\\\ f_y(x,y)&=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\left(-\\left(\\frac{\\left(- x + y\\right)^2}{2}\\right)\\right) \\\\ &=-1\\cdot\\left(- x + y\\right)\\cdot(1)=-\\left(- x + y\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\nabla f(x,y)=\\left(\\left(- x + y\\right)\\right)\\mathbf{i}+\\left(-\\left(- x + y\\right)\\right)\\mathbf{j}.\n$$\n\nFor substitution, write $t(x,y)=- x + y$.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nt(2,-1)&=(-1)(2)+(1)(-1)=-3 \\\\ \\nabla f(2,-1)&=\\langle (1)(-3),\\;(-1)(-3)\\rangle=\\langle -3,\\;3\\rangle \\\\ t(-2,-1)&=(-1)(-2)+(1)(-1)=1 \\\\ \\nabla f(-2,-1)&=\\langle (1)(1),\\;(-1)(1)\\rangle=\\langle 1,\\;-1\\rangle \\\\ t(1,2)&=(-1)(1)+(1)(2)=1 \\\\ \\nabla f(1,2)&=\\langle (1)(1),\\;(-1)(1)\\rangle=\\langle 1,\\;-1\\rangle\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUse the first component as horizontal displacement and the second as vertical displacement. Place each tail at its stated point and compare both direction and length. The matching diagram is:\n\n![](/tmp/ca9837-templates-5ek4tgt5/17592186179719/693e0c0c6f5a0b49733b940e2a4aeee91e481b5b37efc205d0ceea4b0d158843.png)",
